flowchart LR
    U[Upload request] --> API[FastAPI API]
    API --> PUB[ArtifactStore handoff]
    PUB --> SYNC[ingest_published sync call]
    SYNC --> IMP[EvidenceImporter]
    IMP -. optional socket .-> API_SOCK[API has no runner mount]
    WK[Worker heartbeat only] --> WK_SOCK[worker socket mount]
    WK_SOCK --> RUN[Runner: network none]
